CriteriaBuilder cb = em.getCriteriaBuilder();
CriteriaQuery<User> cq = cb.createQuery(User.class);
Root<User> user = cq.from(User.class);
cq.select(user).where(cb.and(
    cb.equal(user.get("email"), "a@x.com"),
    cb.greaterThan(user.get("age"), 18)));
List<User> r = em.createQuery(cq).getResultList();
```

```java
Subquery<Long> subquery = cq.subquery(Long.class);
Root<Order> order = subquery.from(Order.class);
subquery.select(order.get("user").get("id"))
        .where(cb.greaterThan(order.get("total"), 1000));

cq.select(user).where(user.get("id").in(subquery));
```
Эквивалент JPQL: `SELECT u FROM User u WHERE u.id IN (SELECT o.user.id FROM Order o WHERE o.total > 1000)`.

